; Block pattern: blood pool (tiles $80,$80,$3B,$3C)
;
; Defines the current block as two blank tiles over the two blood tiles $3B and $3C, which the animation #R$AE20 swaps
; ($3B and $3C alternate) when op $9E is set. Called by rooms 21, 22, 23.
@label=BlockBloodPool
b$811C DEFB $88,$02,$02,$80,$80,$3B,$3C ; BLOCK 2x2: $80 $80 $3B $3C
 $8123 DEFB $80             ; END
